or:rgb(92,11,214);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><p style=\"margin-bottom:24px;outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(111,19,209);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS BRIEF</span></p></section></section></section></section><section id=\"yaodian\" style=\"margin:20px 10px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">01</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">我国首个全国产十万卡AI超集群“曙光8000”在深圳正式亮相</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">02</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">华盛顿大学等机构发布RFdiffusion3系统，实现原子级蛋白质与核酸设计</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">03</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google DeepMind发布Gemini智能体：4个Agent自主组队击败末影龙</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek发布V4.1-Flash-1017模型，登顶WebDev榜单且成本降低90%</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic拟在上市前捐赠5%股份设立公共利益基金并随估值增长追加</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">我国首个全国产十万卡AI超集群“曙光8000”在深圳正式亮相</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b63c19a215f1ef302247933e7377eef0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在2026全国高性能计算学术大会上，我国首个全国产十万卡AI超集群“曙光8000”真机首次公开亮相。该系统于今年8月正式投入使用，通过高速互联技术整合十万张国产AI加速卡，其峰值算力相当于全人类不间断计算200年的总和。曙光8000采用“超算与智算原生融合”技术路线，在同一算力底座上实现了高精度科学计算与大模型训练推理的兼容，有效解决了单一智算模式下缺乏因果逻辑导致的AI幻觉问题。目前，该集群已服务于新材料研发、创新药研制及人工智能等26个前沿领域的300多种复杂计算任务，并能支持构建“数字孪生大脑”及模拟百亿光年宇宙演化。作为我国算力基础设施迈入十万卡级部署阶段的里程碑，曙光8000为国产高水平科技自立自强提供了关键算力支撑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">华盛顿大学等机构发布RFdiffusion3系统，实现原子级蛋白质与核酸设计</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0c0bb339d46262c171972763d290ce62.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">由华盛顿大学、牛津大学及英伟达组成的国际团队正式公开了生成式AI系统RFdiffusion3的设计方案，该系统具备从单个原子层面设计蛋白质与核酸的能力。RFdiffusion3参考AlphaFold3网络架构，通过直接调整每个原子的三维坐标构建新结构，最多可用14个原子刻画单个氨基酸。相比RFdiffusion2，该系统生成速度提升约十倍，且在41个活性位点对比测试中，有37组表现更优。研究人员可设定氢键条件及原子分布范围等约束，系统能精准输出满足要求的结构。目前，由该系统设计的对氧磷降解酶与肽裂解酶已在真实化学反应中验证了预期功能。该成果于10月16日发表在《科学》期刊，标志着蛋白质工程从结构预测向按功能定制结构迈进，实现了原子级的高精度设计。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google DeepMind发布Gemini智能体：4个Agent自主组队击败末影龙</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google DeepMind近日展示了一项多智能体协作实验，4个Gemini4Argon通用编码智能体在《我的世界》中通过自主分工，历时27小时14分钟成功击败末影龙。不同于以往预设职责的协作模式，这些智能体仅凭游戏内聊天频道和共享笔记进行沟通，全程未操控键鼠，而是通过调用Mineflayer库实时编写2783个程序来执行动作。在累计死亡605次的过程中，智能体通过试错自主摸索出破坏末影水晶的战术，且经独立裁判审计确认无作弊行为。整场挑战中，智能体间仅产生229条沟通消息，展现了极高的协作效率。DeepMind指出，这种无预设架构、长时程、多智能体自主协作能力，标志着AI正从“指令执行”向“自主组队解决复杂难题”的形态演进，未来有望迁移至编码、科研、工程及机器人等领域。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek发布V4.1-Flash-1017模型，登顶WebDev榜单且成本降低90%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dbd8258dd3c8d4d98c4d605ceca02ad6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek正式发布V4.1-Flash-20261017（Max）版本，该模型在Code Arena的WebDev榜单中位列开源模型第一，总榜排名第12。性能方面，其得分较上月版本提升52分，在WebDev基准测试中超越Kimi K3（Max），且推理成本仅为后者的十分之一。该模型定价为每百万输入token 0.3美元、输出token 1.2美元。目前，DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017已上线网页端、App及API，并完成对DeepSeek Harness v0.2.1-rc.1、腾讯CodeBuddy及WorkBuddy等工具的适配。此次更新通过精简冗余输出与优化复杂任务处理，显著降低了开发者的算力与时间成本，进一步刷新了开源模型在推理性能与性价比方面的帕累托最优边界。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic拟在上市前捐赠5%股份设立公共利益基金并随估值增长追加</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1cad2a27af8601fe2ccee7556f592387.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic宣布计划在IPO前设立“公共利益基金”（Public Benefit Fund），初始将划拨5%的股份，并设定动态增资机制：每当公司估值较基准线每上涨50%，基金将额外获得2%的股份。该基金将以全资有限责任公司形式运作，资金用于非营利捐赠、资助特定群体及应对AI对就业的冲击，明确禁止用于政治游说或捐赠。此次动作配合其以共益企业（PBC）架构上市的战略，旨在平衡商业回报与公共利益。加上此前布局，Anthropic累计约20%的股份将服务于公共目的。公司强调，未来数月将披露基金治理结构、估值触发门槛及公共利益报告等细节。此举旨在向资本市场传达其在追求商业增长的同时，将安全与社会责任纳入核心治理框架的立场。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
